cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenProcess in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenProcess: process mining, Petri nets and workflows in one open app"
version: 0.11.1
date-released: 2026-10-12
repository-code: https://github.com/s4mstruthers/openprocess
url: https://github.com/s4mstruthers/openprocess
license: MIT
keywords:
  - process mining
  - Petri nets
  - workflow nets
  - conformance checking
  - teaching
  - reproducible research
authors:
  - family-names: Struthers
    given-names: Sam
abstract: >-
  OpenProcess is a desktop app for process mining and Petri net modelling in which
  every algorithm is a function whose code and source paper are one click away, and
  every analysis keeps a record of its inputs, versions and seeds so that its numbers
  can be checked again.
